# Exynos8890 Samsung SSP sensor-hub protocol core
#

config EXYNOS8890_SSP
	tristate "Exynos8890 Samsung SSP sensor-hub protocol core"
	depends on GNSS_BCM4773
	help
	  Samsung "SSP" application-layer protocol core for the sensor-hub
	  MCU reachable through the BCM4773 GNSS/sensor SPI transport on
	  Exynos8890 Galaxy S7 (herolte) devices. This first milestone only
	  probes the link (WHOAMI handshake); it does not yet enumerate or
	  expose individual sensors as IIO devices.
